{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/649d05a6e82646fa61fdec02f8e6d515.avif?t=1765996534\" width=800 height=499 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>Created by Marco Di Girolamo (15 years old)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;An interactive cinematic experience like you've never had before&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience <i><strong>The Sacrilege,</strong></i> a visual and narrative adventure that combines the language of <i><strong>cinema</strong></i> with the interactivity of <i><strong>video games</strong></i>. Every <strong>scene</strong>, every <strong>shot</strong>, every <i><strong>piece of dialogue</strong></i> has been meticulously crafted to draw you into an <strong>intense</strong>, <strong>dark</strong>, and deeply immersive <strong>dramatic</strong> <i><strong>story</strong></i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A True Vision of Cinematic Direction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in an <i><strong>art-house film</strong></i>, you will be the one to make the <i>film flow</i>: interact with the <strong>environment</strong>, experience the <strong>crucial moments</strong> thanks to the <strong>direction developed in the film.</strong> But to move forward, you'll have to <i>\u201cturn the crank\u201d,</i> just as in the <strong>old film cameras</strong>. Only then can the story continue, <i>blending</i> <i><strong>art and interaction.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/d391d0f3517fd30296535c2aff284adc.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Unforgettable Music Score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>powerful combination</strong> of original cinematic orchestrations, electronics and rock accompanies every moment of the game, <strong>underscoring emotions</strong> and <strong>plot twists</strong> with a <i>unique and evocative style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/9d4b7e3f58750b010352a959478e0ff8.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dramatic Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>plot</strong> unfolds on a <strong>psychological and dramatic horror plane.</strong> It is a story of <strong>death</strong>, <strong>revenge</strong> and <strong>mystery</strong> - <i>a dark enigma just waiting to be solved.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/5de85a7745c5f97aa062d382444b8fb7.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Development Of The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The film for the <strong>player</strong> is divided into <u><strong>CHAPTERS</strong></u>:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>-CHAPTER 1</strong></i><strong>-</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/81991fe95cee4cb3df2ca1e0b3d89cb0.webp?t=1765996534\" width=248 height=37 /></span><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>-CHAPTER 2-</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/624cdeff2ac1f5666e2b6cd09126ed48.webp?t=1765996534\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/624cdeff2ac1f5666e2b6cd09126ed48.poster.avif?t=1765996534\" class=\"bb_img\" width=248 height=37 /></picture></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>-CHAPTER 3-</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/c7c588fb570746222f057c62301270df.webp?t=1765996534\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/c7c588fb570746222f057c62301270df.poster.avif?t=1765996534\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=37 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/6090cb8c154273496ed47af053033371.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>And Now?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I hope you now have your facts straight because this experience is <strong>not suitable</strong> for <strong>everyone</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>I wish you a good adventure...!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NO, AI!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/dce7ab3a7bb29fd26f8ac3c2d682963d504629e9.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/894941250e498c2bbc5ffb0c9480395a27280ba5.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/cad60f942b06e949b26cf4b611b7216c507d84fa.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/9e1a74c2def8f894d4b804f19708049fe8481d69.jpg"},{"name":"A Mysterious Key.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/4aa82c305163465f3b2c9f91edd63bea58f98efe.jpg"},{"name":"An Elf in the Band!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/c007d53f1ad6ee71d8b610b40e16a13e2849d838.jpg"},{"name":"The Dark Past.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/4a53e8908b5c6318160be12f3e0ae76d23728749.jpg"},{"name":"Last, Ciak.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/555b8e194c4176bd4bbdef00e56592f2a73f0fbf.jpg"},{"name":"Sacrilegium.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916020/6674de86f377d0e035826944a768dcd3e8d1c6d4.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916020?t=1765996534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/e92101efabcdfd7a2a08856d5135e4fa5e3b3860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765996534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/11cf7b22fca9369b4975b71fac224a0b39efcfb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765996534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/11cf7b22fca9369b4975b71fac224a0b39efcfb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765996534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is some tough stuff going on here: murder, alcohol. The violence is quite raw, with blood, torture, and scenes that might bother or upset you.\r\n\r\nThere are also moments with very bright, flashing lights, so if you suffer from epilepsy or are sensitive to such things, be careful.\r\n\r\nThis is not a game for everyone, so think carefully before playing."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/649d05a6e82646fa61fdec02f8e6d515.avif?t=1765996534\" width=800 height=499 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>Created by Marco Di Girolamo (15 years old)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;An interactive cinematic experience like you've never had before&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience <i><strong>The Sacrilege,</strong></i> a visual and narrative adventure that combines the language of <i><strong>cinema</strong></i> with the interactivity of <i><strong>video games</strong></i>. Every <strong>scene</strong>, every <strong>shot</strong>, every <i><strong>piece of dialogue</strong></i> has been meticulously crafted to draw you into an <strong>intense</strong>, <strong>dark</strong>, and deeply immersive <strong>dramatic</strong> <i><strong>story</strong></i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A True Vision of Cinematic Direction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in an <i><strong>art-house film</strong></i>, you will be the one to make the <i>film flow</i>: interact with the <strong>environment</strong>, experience the <strong>crucial moments</strong> thanks to the <strong>direction developed in the film.</strong> But to move forward, you'll have to <i>\u201cturn the crank\u201d,</i> just as in the <strong>old film cameras</strong>. Only then can the story continue, <i>blending</i> <i><strong>art and interaction.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/d391d0f3517fd30296535c2aff284adc.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Unforgettable Music Score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>powerful combination</strong> of original cinematic orchestrations, electronics and rock accompanies every moment of the game, <strong>underscoring emotions</strong> and <strong>plot twists</strong> with a <i>unique and evocative style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/9d4b7e3f58750b010352a959478e0ff8.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dramatic Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>plot</strong> unfolds on a <strong>psychological and dramatic horror plane.</strong> It is a story of <strong>death</strong>, <strong>revenge</strong> and <strong>mystery</strong> - <i>a dark enigma just waiting to be solved.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/5de85a7745c5f97aa062d382444b8fb7.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Development Of The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The film for the <strong>player</strong> is divided into <u><strong>CHAPTERS</strong></u>:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>-CHAPTER 1</strong></i><strong>-</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/81991fe95cee4cb3df2ca1e0b3d89cb0.webp?t=1765996534\" width=248 height=37 /></span><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>-CHAPTER 2-</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/624cdeff2ac1f5666e2b6cd09126ed48.webp?t=1765996534\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/624cdeff2ac1f5666e2b6cd09126ed48.poster.avif?t=1765996534\" class=\"bb_img\" width=248 height=37 /></picture></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>-CHAPTER 3-</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/c7c588fb570746222f057c62301270df.webp?t=1765996534\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/c7c588fb570746222f057c62301270df.poster.avif?t=1765996534\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=37 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/6090cb8c154273496ed47af053033371.webp?t=1765996534\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>And Now?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I hope you now have your facts straight because this experience is <strong>not suitable</strong> for <strong>everyone</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>I wish you a good adventure...!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","developers":["Marco Di Girolamo"],"dlc":[4037250],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/e028993b7e6e49fa19c16a8a29f2c41e9dd57d81/header.jpg?t=1765996534","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Marco Di Girolamo. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n\u2117 2025 Supremus Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916020/1153074904/fe624b11e8c98df648823f86488c2c7edd7adae4/1760213673/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760216135","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916020/1153074904/fe624b11e8c98df648823f86488c2c7edd7adae4/1760213673/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760216135","highlight":true,"hls_h26