31d.600x338.jpg?t=1765996534"}],"short_description":"The Sacrilege is a 2D movie-game with interactive minigames to advance the film. The plot follows a newly pastor, starting over in the same town where his past vanished into darkness years ago. But that darkness never went away and... it is about to return.","steam_appid":3916020,"support_info":{"email":"supremusgames.helpcenter@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://open.spotify.com/intl-it/album/5gRLRTHqzOc5aVIdeua38h?si=tha_yktCTkGxMtM0s5aW1Q"}